 ## Background
-The MPVO algorithm was described by Williams [27] and similarly by Max et al. [15] [S3, unofficial]. It is based on the observation that for convex meshes, local occlusion relations across shared faces define a partial order that can be topologically sorted to yield a correct global visibility order [S3, unofficial]. It is a foundational method for cell projection volume rendering [S3, unofficial].
